    "story": {
      "eyebrow": "Our Story",
      "title": "From one machine to a full room",
      "paragraph1": "Coffeepoint opened in 2010 in a quiet corner of the city with one espresso machine and a stubborn preference for good beans. The shop grew around that machine and the people who kept coming back.",
      "paragraph2": "We buy our beans from sustainable farms in Ethiopia, Colombia, and Guatemala. Every roast is shaped around the character of the farm it came from.",
